{"name": "Battle Lads", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The demo of Battle Lads lets you play as the Beastmen, Mad and Synth tribes as you take on the early Crucibles. You'll encounter other tribes, as well as many dangers and power-ups found on the Shifting Isles. This is an early gameplay preview. We would love to build the game along with the community, any feedback you have is appreciated!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We wanted big war strategy without the time commitment. Plan on a turn-based map, fight the battles in real time, and lead tribes like the Synths and Ronin through short, replayable campaigns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/b7e968bb0464897b58e0328417640977.webp?t=1782880981\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"380\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/de3b729ffb3b5ac4d27a649c218427ac.poster.avif?t=1782880981\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/de3b729ffb3b5ac4d27a649c218427ac.webm?t=1782880981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/de3b729ffb3b5ac4d27a649c218427ac.mp4?t=1782880981\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each tribe comes packed with their own <strong>abilities, units, and upgrades</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/55648e07c0b53a6521bf4e7ea1973995.webp?t=1782880981\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"284\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/0f759418aca38891b251432cb6a1108f.poster.avif?t=1782880981\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/0f759418aca38891b251432cb6a1108f.webm?t=1782880981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/0f759418aca38891b251432cb6a1108f.mp4?t=1782880981\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bring <strong>glory to your tribe</strong> by seizing islands teeming with enemies, strange artifacts and <strong>game-changing events</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/6b617751e0ae6d70f7561b0390e495cb.webp?t=1782880981\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"284\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/1d5d4b4513294212dafff736652d0cfc.poster.avif?t=1782880981\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/1d5d4b4513294212dafff736652d0cfc.webm?t=1782880981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/1d5d4b4513294212dafff736652d0cfc.mp4?t=1782880981\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hack and slash through enemies with devastating <strong>abilities</strong> while commanding your lads in <strong>real-time battles</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/76eb109ad85473095b5a35abc15b8ffe.webp?t=1782880981\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"284\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/ef327c2caa3edd0dd6f43b2331d750b4.poster.avif?t=1782880981\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/ef327c2caa3edd0dd6f43b2331d750b4.webm?t=1782880981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/ef327c2caa3edd0dd6f43b2331d750b4.mp4?t=1782880981\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit lads and mighty <strong>champions</strong> to fill up your war wagon. Each comes with their own <strong>moveset</strong> and <strong>random traits</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every campaign plays out differently with <strong>new tribes</strong>, <strong>new maps</strong> and<strong> war-hungry island spirits</strong> eager to see you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Fight and Command at Once</strong> \u2013 Hack and slash enemies with powerful abilities while directing your lads in real-time battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Conquer the Island</strong> \u2013 Expand territory, capture outposts, and outsmart rival tribes across a procedurally generated map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Recruit Champions</strong> \u2013 Each tribe has unique heroes with special attacks and traits that completely change how battles unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f <strong>Command Your Villagers</strong> \u2013 Collect villagers to issue new orders: heal your lads, invest gold, or toss a few lads into the sacrificial pit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Build and Upgrade</strong> \u2013 Construct gold mines, garages, and trebuchets, then strengthen them to power your growing war machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Tribes with Attitude</strong> \u2013 Pick from Beasts, Ronin, Mad, Knights, Slashers, and Synths. Each has their own abilities, units, and distinctive style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Highly Replayable</strong> \u2013 Short campaigns packed with unpredictable encounters, escalating wars, and upgrades that turn your ragtag army into an unstoppable band of maniacs.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "We wanted big war strategy without the time commitment. Plan on a turn-based map, fight the battles in real time, and lead tribes like the Synths and Ronin through fast roguelike campaigns.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/7771c2a1fe7f011037fdf3c5fee9705e13e9869a/header.jpg?t=1782880981", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Hack and Slash", "Wargame", "Action RTS", "Turn-Based Strategy", "Roguelike"], "developers": "Burning Bagel Games LLC", "publishers": "Burning Bagel Games LLC", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3377150", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "3 February 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/__IXntXvA84", "first_seen": 1770073200.0, "review_rank": 1315}